         button, which opens the app's speech models. %1$s in the button and in what TalkBack reads is the app name; %1$d
         and %2$d a percentage. -->
    <string name="bubble_speech_downloading">Your speech model is still downloading (%1$d%%).</string>
    <string name="bubble_speech_wifi">Your speech model is waiting for Wi-Fi.</string>
    <string name="bubble_speech_connection">Your speech model is waiting for a connection.</string>
    <string name="bubble_speech_preparing">Your speech model is almost ready.</string>
